        "html": "<h3>Check the story</h3>\n<p>先不看译文，回答下面的问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>When did Daniel reply to Maya after their chance meeting?</li>\n<li>What has Maya done since Daniel left Riverton?</li>\n<li>When did Maya take her most recent training course?</li>\n<li>Does Daniel commute now?</li>\n<li>What did Daniel photograph last Sunday?</li>\n<li>What new idea does Maya suggest?</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n"
