        "id": "section-2",
        "title": "2. Main Conversation",
        "html": "<h3>Getting to the City History Museum</h3>\n<p>Maya and Ben are at Union Square Station. They study the map, but two Blue Line platforms go in opposite directions.</p>\n<h3>Part A — Asking for the route</h3>\n<p><strong>Maya:</strong> Excuse me, which line should we take for the City History Museum?</p>\n<p><strong>Station attendant:</strong> Take the Blue Line toward Airport.</p>\n<p><strong>Ben:</strong> Which platform do we need for the Blue Line?</p>\n<p><strong>Station attendant:</strong> Platform 2. The stairs are on your left, beyond the ticket machines.</p>\n<p><strong>Maya:</strong> Is there an elevator nearby?</p>\n<p><strong>Station attendant:</strong> Yes. It&#39;s beside the stairs and goes to the same platform.</p>\n<p><strong>Ben:</strong> Do we stay on the Blue Line all the way?</p>\n<p><strong>Station attendant:</strong> No. Change at Central Station for the Green Line.</p>\n<p><strong>Maya:</strong> Which direction on the Green Line?</p>\n<p><strong>Station attendant:</strong> Take the train toward Hill Park and get off at Museum Square.</p>\n<p><strong>Ben:</strong> How many stops is that from here?</p>\n<p><strong>Station attendant:</strong> Three stops to Central, then two more to Museum Square.</p>\n<h3>Part B — Confirming the route</h3>\n<p><strong>Maya:</strong> Let me make sure I&#39;ve got this right. First, we take the Blue Line toward Airport for three stops.</p>\n<p><strong>Station attendant:</strong> Correct.</p>\n<p><strong>Maya:</strong> Then we change at Central for the Green Line toward Hill Park.</p>\n<p><strong>Station attendant:</strong> Right. Get off at Museum Square.</p>\n<p><strong>Ben:</strong> Which exit should we use?</p>\n<p><strong>Station attendant:</strong> Follow the signs for Exit C. The museum is across from the station.</p>\n<p><strong>Ben:</strong> So: Blue toward Airport, change at Central, Green toward Hill Park, off at Museum Square, Exit C.</p>\n<p><strong>Station attendant:</strong> Exactly.</p>\n<p><strong>Maya:</strong> Thanks. Now the map makes sense.</p>\n<p><strong>Station attendant:</strong> You&#39;re welcome. Have a good visit.</p>\n<p>They reach Museum Square without taking a train in the wrong direction.</p>\n<h3>Check the story</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Where are Maya and Ben going?</li>\n<li>Which direction do they take on the Blue Line?</li>\n<li>Where do they change?</li>\n<li>Which direction do they take on the Green Line?</li>\n<li>How many stops are there before and after the change?</li>\n<li>Which exit do they use?</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n"
