        "title": "6. Grammar Refresh — 指令、顺序与方位介词",
        "html": "<h3>1. 路线指令用动词原形</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Take</strong> the Blue Line.<br><strong>Change</strong> at Central.<br><strong>Get off</strong> at Museum Square.<br><strong>Follow</strong> the signs.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这些祈使句在指路中是中性说明，不自动等于不礼貌命令。</p>\n<h3>2. 四个小介词各有任务</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>toward</strong> Airport：行车方向；</li>\n<li>change <strong>at</strong> Central：动作发生的站；</li>\n<li>change <strong>for</strong> the Green Line：换到的新线路；</li>\n<li>two stops <strong>from</strong> Central：以Central为起点计算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>3. 用顺序词让路线可执行</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>First</strong>, take …<br><strong>Then</strong>, change …<br><strong>Finally</strong>, get off …</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>快速练习</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Take the Green Line __________ Hill Park.</li>\n<li>Change __________ Central __________ the Blue Line.</li>\n<li>Get __________ at Library.</li>\n<li>Museum Square is two stops __________ Central.</li>\n<li>__________ the signs for Exit C. <em>(follow)</em></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n"
