      {
        "id": "section-10",
        "title": "10. Answer Key",
        "html": "<h3>Check the story</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>10:20.</li>\n<li>Thirty-five minutes.</li>\n<li>10:55 and 12:05.</li>\n<li>Platform 4 is closed for maintenance.</li>\n<li>Take the 10:35 local and change at East Gate.</li>\n<li>It still arrives earlier and avoids a transfer with bags.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Read, Notice, Understand</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>HC 220. 2. AP 410. 3. No. 4. Platform 7.<br>Notice: Platform 4; 9:00 a.m.–1:00 p.m.; scheduled maintenance; Platform 7; yellow signs.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Grammar Refresh</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>has  2. is  3. moved  4. has  5. has</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>F  2. T  3. F  4. T  5. F  6. T</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. 参考</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The train was scheduled to leave at 10:20, but it now leaves at 10:55. It has been delayed by thirty-five minutes. The departure has been moved to Platform 7 because Platform 4 is closed. The estimated arrival is 12:05.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>D. 参考消息</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hi Sam, our 10:20 train to Harbor City has been delayed by thirty-five minutes and moved from Platform 4 to Platform 7. We considered the local train, but we&#39;re waiting for the direct service because it still arrives earlier. Our estimated arrival is 12:05. I&#39;ll update you if that changes.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>G. Lesson 17间隔检索参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Is this seat taken?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Do you mind if I sit here?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Go ahead.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>It&#39;s busier than usual today.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I&#39;ll let you get back to your writing.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Have a good trip.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>开放题必须依据公告；合理替代决定可以不同，但要说明条件和影响。</p>\n<hr>\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "section-11",
        "title": "11. Self-check",
        "html": "<p>为每项选择：<strong>能做到／还不稳定／需要重学</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>我能区分原时间、新时间、延误时长和预计到达。</li>\n<li>我能识别站台变化与基础被动表达。</li>\n<li>我知道 <strong>train&#39;s been</strong> 中的 <strong>&#39;s</strong> 是 <strong>has</strong>。</li>\n<li>我能比较等待与替代路线，不把方案说成已经决定。</li>\n<li>我能把公告事实、个人决定和对同伴的影响写清楚。</li>\n<li>我不会给公告添加没有证据的原因、退款或保证。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果有两项以上选择“需要重学”，重做第3部分和第7部分B、D、E。</p>\n"
      }
