        "html": "<h3>Check the story</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>About ten days. 2. No. 3. After she works for an hour. 4. When it starts and what makes it worse. 5. At five that day. 6. Yes.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Grammar Refresh</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>might  2. should  3. call  4. happening  5. what it is</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>T  2. F  3. T  4. T  5. F  6. T</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. 建议强度</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>might want to  2. should  3. had better  4. seek urgent help</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>C. 参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>It will help the technician see the damage before the screen changes.</li>\n<li>The problem has continued after a restart.</li>\n<li>The battery is almost empty, so unsaved work may be lost.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>E. Lesson 20间隔检索参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>If we wait, when will it be ready?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>We&#39;d prefer to keep the room with the desk.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>开放题只评价建议强度、理由和边界。任何紧急健康情境都应停止普通练习并寻求当地专业帮助。</p>\n<hr>\n"
