        "html": "<h3>Check the story</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Every twenty or thirty minutes. 2. Her laptop and phone. 3. Client calls and large file uploads. 4. Turned it off for thirty seconds, turned it on and waited for steady lights. 5. Yes. 6. RV-4821; tomorrow from ten to noon.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Read, Notice, Understand</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>No. 2. About one minute. 3. Calls and uploads. 4. No; it records the pattern, not the cause.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Grammar Refresh</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>freezing  2. every  3. restarting  4. Then  5. is</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>F  2. T  3. F  4. T  5. F  6. T</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>C. 参考</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>First, I turned the router off. Then I turned it back on and waited for steady lights. After that, I tested the laptop. The problem is still happening.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>E. Lesson 21间隔检索参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>I&#39;ve had this headache for four days.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>It started on Thursday morning.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>It&#39;s been worse since Saturday.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>It gets worse when I climb stairs.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I haven&#39;t had any fever.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>That&#39;s everything I&#39;ve noticed.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>开放题必须依据日志；现象、原因和解决结果不能混为一谈。</p>\n<hr>\n"
