        "html": "<h3>Check the story</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>A full Friday morning release. 2. The accessibility check will not be finished. 3. Some staff may receive a file their screen reader cannot use properly. 4. Five people. 5. By Friday noon. 6. Monday at nine.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Grammar Refresh</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>send  2. can  3. skip  4. concern  5. use</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>F  2. T  3. F  4. T  5. F  6. T</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. 参考</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>I&#39;m not sure that will work. My concern is that three people leave at five. If we start at 4:30, they will miss most of the meeting. What if we start at three instead?</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>C. 参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>people will open the wrong page.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>we can hold the review there.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>we can confirm the order tomorrow.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>the final reviewer responds by noon.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h3>E. Lesson 22延迟迁移参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>You might want to test the file with a small group.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>It might be a good idea to record the results.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>You should complete the accessibility check before full release.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>You&#39;d better book now, or the booking will close.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>If it keeps happening, record the version and time.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I can&#39;t tell what it is, but you should contact qualified support.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h3>F. Lesson 25间隔检索参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Did you get my message about the changed meeting room?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I&#39;ve just sent the new room number.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I&#39;ve already replied.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I haven&#39;t seen the updated invitation yet.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Could you check your spam folder?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I&#39;ll send it again.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>开放题必须包含具体限制和可执行替代。<strong>That might work</strong> 只有在后续出现明确同意时才算最终决定。</p>\n<hr>\n"
