        "html": "<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Daniel had clearly confirmed Saturday morning.</li>\n<li>Lena treated a tentative message as a final yes.</li>\n<li>Daniel has no other Saturday commitment.</li>\n<li>Lena asks Daniel to explain her mistake to Owen.</li>\n<li>Another Saturday volunteer is found.</li>\n<li>Daniel confirms Sunday only after receiving the exact time.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. 修复的五步</h3>\n<p>将句子标为 <strong>impact / responsibility / apology / correction / boundary</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>I received a final booking I hadn&#39;t approved.</li>\n<li>I should&#39;ve checked with you.</li>\n<li>I&#39;m sorry I used your name without asking.</li>\n<li>I&#39;ll correct the group message now.</li>\n<li>Nothing is confirmed until everyone replies.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>C. 去掉假道歉</h3>\n<p>改写：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>I&#39;m sorry, but you misunderstood me.</li>\n<li>I&#39;m sorry you were annoyed.</li>\n<li>I only did it because nobody else would help.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>每句至少加入一项具体责任或纠正行动。</p>\n<h3>D. 未知修复回应</h3>\n<p>伙伴A抽取事件卡：<strong>shared a tentative time / borrowed an item / changed a group message / invited someone on another person&#39;s behalf</strong>。伙伴B随机提出一种影响。A不能争论感受，必须承认、道歉、询问并纠正。</p>\n<h3>E. Lesson 28间隔检索（二）</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>State the exact deadline for returning borrowed equipment.</li>\n<li>Promise to send a short written summary after the discussion.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>F. 实用写作</h3>\n<p>写75—95词修复消息：说明收到的反馈、承认漏掉的步骤、为具体行为道歉、说明立即纠正什么，并让对方重新确认选择。</p>\n<hr>\n"
