        "html": "<h3>A. Three levels of clarity</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Line</th>\n<th>Clear joke signal?</th>\n<th>What to do</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>“You can take over the whole café next week.”</td>\n<td>unclear in context</td>\n<td>Ask: <strong>Are you serious?</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>“Sure, and I&#39;ll finish all 300 boxes before lunch!” <em>(laughs, then explains)</em></td>\n<td>clear exaggeration plus explanation</td>\n<td>Respond if comfortable; still ask if unsure</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>“I need you to cover the counter at two.”</td>\n<td>clear practical request</td>\n<td>Confirm availability and responsibility</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>信号只能帮助理解，不能保证所有人都会用相同方式表达玩笑。</p>\n<h3>B. Intention and effect</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Intention:</strong> Owen wanted to praise Grace&#39;s organization.<br><strong>Effect:</strong> Grace heard a possible work request.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>修复需要同时说明两层。只重复 <strong>I was joking</strong> 并不能解释为什么对方会误解。</p>\n<h3>C. Old photographs note</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Box 3: labels, receipts, several photographs from the former bookshop. Keep together; ownership and permission not checked.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这张记录只说明发现了照片，不等于照片已经可以公开使用，也不等于影像展已经立项。</p>\n<hr>\n"
