        "title": "6. Grammar Refresh — only与just收窄原意",
        "html": "<h3>1. only kidding / just joking</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I was <strong>only kidding</strong>.<br>I was <strong>just joking</strong>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>两者都说明意图是玩笑；自然度取决于语气和后续解释。</p>\n<h3>2. only / just不能删除影响</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I was only kidding, <strong>but I can see why it sounded serious</strong>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>3. I thought you meant …</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I thought you meant <strong>you needed me to work next week</strong>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>4. sound like + 名词／句子</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It sounded like <strong>a real request</strong>.<br>It sounded like <strong>you had already decided</strong>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>快速练习</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>I was only __________. <em>(kid)</em></li>\n<li>Are you __________?</li>\n<li>I thought you __________ you needed help tomorrow.</li>\n<li>I didn&#39;t realize it sounded __________ a complaint.</li>\n<li>Thanks for clearing that __________.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n"
