        "html": "<h3>Raw meeting notes</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>v0.8 — Daniel 2:00<br>wording — Lena 3:00<br>logistics — Sam 3:15<br>approval — Priya 4:00<br>backup name? Priya Fri 10:00<br>send to 2 opening-hour greeters Fri noon<br>internal / 1 page / operations only / old draft replaced</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>从笔记到行动项</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Decision / action</th>\n<th>Owner</th>\n<th>Due</th>\n<th>Dependency / status</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>upload v0.8</td>\n<td>Daniel</td>\n<td>Thu 2:00</td>\n<td>include three feedback revisions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>check wording</td>\n<td>Lena</td>\n<td>Thu 3:00</td>\n<td>v0.8 uploaded</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>verify logistics</td>\n<td>Sam</td>\n<td>Thu 3:15</td>\n<td>access + role extensions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>final sign-off</td>\n<td>Priya</td>\n<td>Thu 4:00</td>\n<td>both checks recorded</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fill backup name</td>\n<td>Priya</td>\n<td>Fri 10:00</td>\n<td>volunteer assignment</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>send internal PDF</td>\n<td>Priya</td>\n<td>Fri noon</td>\n<td>sign-off + backup name</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n"
